WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.398 --> 00:00:03.749
- It tastes like brains.

00:00:03.749 --> 00:00:06.666
(thunder crashing)

00:00:19.727 --> 00:00:21.309
- Today we're trying zombie frappuccinos.

00:00:21.309 --> 00:00:22.464
- I personally love the idea

00:00:22.464 --> 00:00:24.249
of all these crazy frappuccinos.

00:00:24.249 --> 00:00:25.179
- Hopefully it's not too scary.

00:00:25.179 --> 00:00:28.587
- I actually prefer Starbucks
over local coffee places.

00:00:28.587 --> 00:00:30.804
- I almost broke down
and got the unicorn one.

00:00:30.804 --> 00:00:32.746
- What made you like, compelled to try it?

00:00:32.746 --> 00:00:34.102
- The color.

00:00:34.102 --> 00:00:35.269
- Zombie time.

00:00:37.887 --> 00:00:38.720
- Ooh!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.591
- What?

00:00:40.591 --> 00:00:41.487
- It's like a work of art.

00:00:41.487 --> 00:00:42.320
- Brains.

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:43.472
- It does look like Frankenstein.

00:00:43.472 --> 00:00:46.969
- It's like half a unicorn and
half a disgusting dead thing.

00:00:46.969 --> 00:00:48.493
- Oh my god, it looks like a sculpture.

00:00:48.493 --> 00:00:50.522
- It's not scary, it's more cute.

00:00:50.522 --> 00:00:51.719
- I see purple, I'm like,

00:00:51.719 --> 00:00:52.654
"Ooh, this is gonna be grape flavored,"

00:00:52.654 --> 00:00:54.668
but it's just whipped cream.

00:00:54.668 --> 00:00:55.715
- I think that's blueberry.

00:00:55.715 --> 00:00:56.634
That looks like blueberry to me.

00:00:56.634 --> 00:00:57.484
- I taste banana in this.

00:00:57.484 --> 00:00:58.341
Am I tripping?

00:00:58.341 --> 00:00:59.246
- I taste apple.

00:00:59.246 --> 00:01:02.328
- It doesn't make me think
zombie, though, when I see this.

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:03.774
- It makes me think of like, fairies.

00:01:03.774 --> 00:01:04.893
- It's actually not that sweet to me.

00:01:04.893 --> 00:01:06.852
- I like the combination
of all the flavors.

00:01:06.852 --> 00:01:08.600
- Mm-hmm, it's very random though

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.668
'cause the top tastes totally
different from the inside.

00:01:10.668 --> 00:01:14.245
- I get a little bit of
green apple with some caramel

00:01:14.245 --> 00:01:16.396
and then an odd like, hint of chocolate.

00:01:16.396 --> 00:01:19.548
- This is good for like,
like a birthday party

00:01:19.548 --> 00:01:22.307
for someone who really likes Starbucks.

00:01:22.307 --> 00:01:23.807
- It's like kiwis.

00:01:25.789 --> 00:01:28.126
- There were like 12 flavors in that sip.

00:01:28.126 --> 00:01:29.897
- This tastes like a caramel apple.

00:01:29.897 --> 00:01:32.401
If that's what it's supposed
to be, it's pretty accurate.

00:01:32.401 --> 00:01:33.865
- I mean, I taste banana still.

00:01:33.865 --> 00:01:36.192
I don't taste apples at all.

00:01:36.192 --> 00:01:37.597
- I would much rather just have coffee

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.798
and have some fro yo separately.

00:01:39.798 --> 00:01:40.892
- Keep incorporating food.

00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:42.478
Maybe throw some kale in there next time.

00:01:42.478 --> 00:01:44.592
- No, that's too much.

00:01:44.592 --> 00:01:45.425
- It's like you're drinking

00:01:45.425 --> 00:01:47.185
three different Starbucks drinks in one.

00:01:47.185 --> 00:01:49.123
- I'd be so terrified of the amount

00:01:49.123 --> 00:01:50.425
of the calories that are in this.

00:01:50.425 --> 00:01:51.792
- Do we have our daily value of sugar

00:01:51.792 --> 00:01:54.885
just drinking it from here to here?

00:01:54.885 --> 00:01:57.354
- Yeah, this is like a
week's worth of sugar.

00:01:57.354 --> 00:01:58.187
- Yeah.

00:01:58.187 --> 00:01:59.266
- I just don't know if I could like,

00:01:59.266 --> 00:02:02.647
walk into a place and be like, order this

00:02:02.647 --> 00:02:04.386
and then walk out like a normal person.

00:02:04.386 --> 00:02:06.108
- I wanna see like a vampire one,

00:02:06.108 --> 00:02:08.433
which is just completely red,

00:02:08.433 --> 00:02:10.372
maybe with like, black
whipped cream on top.

00:02:10.372 --> 00:02:11.219
That would be so cool.

00:02:11.219 --> 00:02:13.255
- A Santa one, you know.

00:02:13.255 --> 00:02:14.140
- What would it taste like?

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:16.193
A guy that touches kids?

00:02:16.193 --> 00:02:17.155
- I would like to see a griffin.

00:02:17.155 --> 00:02:19.938
It's not associated with a
holiday, but it's very cool.

00:02:19.938 --> 00:02:22.521
(upbeat music)

